	cGovern Centennial Gardens. From 8 a.m. to 11 a.m.\, come help with season
	al tasks like planting\, weeding\, mulching\, and pruning. A great way to 
	connect with others and make a visible impact in the Park! \nNo experience
	 needed. All ages are welcome. \nMeet at the Family Garden in McGovern Cen
